title: FishQuestComplete
tags: quests
---
<<if $Fishquest_status == "started">>
Fish: Have you been able to get any bigger?
-> Slimes: Yeah, we got them right here Fish!
    <<if $Fishquest_amount < $Fishquest_count>>
        Fish: Let me check your big stat progress
        Fish: you've sucked off {$Fishquest_amount} slimes, You need to be at least {$Fishquest_count} slimes tall
    <<elseif $Fishquest_amount == $Fishquest_count>>
        <<set $Fishquest_status = "completed">>
        Fish: Holy Smackeronies! You're so tall, please don't eat me you'll get Salmon-ella poisoning
        Fish: Hehe....
        Fish: Here's a key for your troubles buddy
        <<give_reward QuestGiverFish>>
    <<endif>>
-> Slimes: Not yet, were still missing some
    Fish: Come back when you're really tall!
<<elseif $Fishquest_status == "completed">>
    Fish: Thanks for gaining all that tall stat!
<<else>>
    Fish: Wow how did you get that tall!? 
    Fish: Here's a key for your troubles
    <<give_reward QuestGiverFish>>
<<endif>>
===
